===== Limitations =====

The supported channels of the two 5 GHz radios are severely limited:

  * radio0: supports channels 100 - 144, 149 - 165 (no DFS/TPC needed in the USA).
  * radio1: supports channels 36 - 64 (no DFS/TPC needed in the USA).

Channels 32, 68, 96 and 169 - 177 are unusable on either radios.
This means that these devices cannot in general connect as clients to existing 5 GHz networks, and thus cannot repeat them, which severely limits the usefulness of having dual 5 GHz radios.

Also, you cannot tie the WAN and LAN ports together under the same VLAN because they live on different switches.
